{
  "name": "Auto-post blog posts to X, LinkedIn, and Facebook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto-post blog posts to X, LinkedIn, and Facebook\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs automatically every day.\n2. Fetches the latest items from the RSS feed.\n3. Publishes posts to X (Twitter), LinkedIn, and Facebook via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Set the RSS feed URL to your own feed.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Replace the example captions in the Publish nodes with your own text.\n\n### Customization\n\nPoint the RSS node at a different feed to reuse the workflow for another blog or channel. Remove the Publish nodes you do not need to target fewer platforms.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 568
      },
      "id": "8678586e-b459-43c1-8f08-294085feb5f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
